   - representative_diseases: 1-4 SPECIFIC, CANONICAL disease entities this child
     covers, written for a textbook/PubMed lookup (e.g. "CML Blast Crisis" →
     ["chronic myeloid leukemia"]). Used ONLY for knowledge lookup. If the child
     label is itself already a specific disease, repeat it canonically here.

